<title>USA: Medstone International Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Medstone International Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ALISO VIEJO, Calif. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>March 31, 1997</p>
<p>					   For the three months ended</p>
<p>				    Mar 31, 1997	   Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p> Revenues			   $4,962,128	     $4,102,334</p>
<p> Operating income		  1,379,378		1,334,469</p>
<p> Income before taxes	     1,300,454		  967,314</p>
<p> Net income			    860,454		  617,314</p>
<p> Net income per share(1)		 .16			.11</p>
<p>Number of shares used in</p>
<p>the computation of earnings</p>
<p> per share			   5,509,381		5,676,863</p>
<p>(1) Fully diluted per share information is not presented for periods in which the effect is not dilutive.</p>
</text>
